  "normalization_notes": [
    "Fairness is not a standalone Yellow core trait because endorsing fairness is commonly a universal virtue; relational trust, loyalty, harmony, support, continuity, and belonging are the diagnostic motives.",
    "Introversion and sociability are not standalone color traits. The model distinguishes Blue expressive breadth, Yellow relational depth, and Green evidence/structure preferences.",
    "Risk appetite is not independently established as a Red trait. Change/risk items must expose an established motive such as momentum, novelty, continuity, or predictability.",
    "Competence, courage, kindness, intelligence, accuracy, directness, and organization do not independently qualify an item for any color.",
    "Use general-cross-context only when no concrete context is necessary; concrete ordinary-life contexts are preferred when they reveal the same motive without occupational dependence."
